  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab><hi rend="allcaps">Acted But Once.</hi><lb/>
               <placeName ref="namedentities.xml#lyceum"><hi rend="allcaps">Theatre Royal, Lyceum</hi></placeName><lb/>
               Under the Authority of Lord Chamberlain.<lb/>
               This present <hi rend="allcaps">Friday, <date when="1811-02-01">February 1, 1811</date></hi>.<lb/>
               Their Majesties Servants will Act an entirely New <hi rend="italic">Operatic Drama</hi>, in Three Acts,<lb/>
               called The<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_peasant_boy">Peasant Boy.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">With New Music, Scenes, Dresses, and Decorations</hi>.<lb/>
               The <hi rend="smallcaps">Overture</hi> and <hi rend="smallcaps">Music, Entirely Original</hi>.<lb/>
               Composed by <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mi_ke">Mr. <hi rend="smallcaps">Kelly</hi></persName>.<lb/>
               Three Pieces only excepted from the <hi rend="allcaps">MS.</hi> of <hi rend="allcaps">Winter</hi>.<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head><hi rend="italic">The Characters by</hi></head><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Kelly</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ch_ho">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Holland</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ja_ra">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Raymond</hi></actor>,</castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#th_ph">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Philipps</hi></actor>,</castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Waldegrave</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ge_sm">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Smith</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Carr</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Miller</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#wa_ma">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Maddocks</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Lee</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#al_we">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Webb</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_ch">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Chatterley</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Evans</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_ox">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Oxberry</hi></actor>,</castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_lo">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Lovegrove</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ja_po">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps"> Powell</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_da">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Duncan</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Poole</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_bl"> Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Bland</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_ma">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Maddocks</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               <hi rend="allcaps"><hi rend="italic">The Chorusses By</hi></hi><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem>Messrs. <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ch_da">Danby</actor>, <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_ca">Caulfield</actor>, <actor>Cook</actor>, <actor>Wilson</actor>, <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_me">Mead</actor>, <actor>Jones</actor>, <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_di">Dibble</actor>, <actor>Whilmshurst</actor><lb/>
                     <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_go">Goodman</actor>, <actor ref="namedentities.xml#j_we">Wells</actor>, <actor>Hope</actor>, <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ch_ma">Mathews</actor>, <actor>Gussio</actor>, <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_vi">Vials</actor>, &amp;c. &amp;c.<lb/>
                     Messrs. <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mo_me">Menage</actor>, <actor ref="namedentities.xml#wa_ma">Maddocks</actor>, <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_ch">Chatterley</actor>, <actor>Jones</actor>, <actor ref="namedentities.xml#j_we">Wells</actor>, <actor>Valencey</actor>, <actor>Barrett</actor><lb/>
                     <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_ca">Caulfield</actor>, <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_mi">Minton</actor>, <actor>I. Boyce</actor>,&amp;c. &amp;c.</castItem></castList><lb/>
               The Principal <hi rend="allcaps">Scenes</hi>, Entirely New, Designed &amp; Painted by Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Morris</hi>.<lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">Books of the <hi rend="allcaps">Songs</hi> may be had in the Theatre, and at the Dramatic Repository,</hi><lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">Great Russell Street, Covent Garden.</hi><lb/>
               To which will be added, the Musical Farce of<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_hit_miss"><hi rend="allcaps">Hit or Miss!</hi></title></bibl><lb/>
               The Overture and Music composed by <persName ref="namedentities.xml#ch_sm">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">C. Smith</hi></persName>.<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Adam Sterling,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Penley</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Janus Jumbule,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#vi_de">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">De Camp</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Dick Cypher,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ch_ma">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Mathews</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Jerry Blossom,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Knight</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>O'Rourke O'Daisy,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_he_jo">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Johnstone</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Quill,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_ch">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Chatterley</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>John,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Miller</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Servant,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Evans</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Mrs. Augusta Caroline Honeymouth,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_ma">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Maddocks</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Clara Sterling,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Poole</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Delly O'Daisy,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_bl">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Bland</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               Boxes and Places to be taken of Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Spring</hi>, at the Box Office in the<lb/>
               Strand Entrance, of whom may also be had <hi rend="allcaps">Private Boxes</hi> Nightly.<lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">Vivant Rex et Regina!-No Money to be returned.</hi><lb/>
               The New Operatic Drama of The <hi rend="allcaps">Peasant Boy</hi>, performed<lb/>
               last night, (for the first time) was recieved with the highest approbation, and<lb/>
               announced for repetition with reiterated bursts of applause, from all parts of<lb/>
               the Theatre, and will be repeated every evening till further notice.<lb/></ab>
         </div>
